scriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Off to Deliver noodles...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But the road ahead is swarming with crazed space bugs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your steel delivery backpack, arm yourself, and fight your way through to complete the delivery!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Run &amp; Gun</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569400/extras/run_and_gun.gif?t=1742799677\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Break through endless swarms of alien bugs and push forward to your destination.<br>Dodge relentless attacks from all sides, find enemy weak points, and strike back with precision!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Backpack Building</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569400/extras/v1_backpack_en.gif?t=1742799677\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unleash the true power of your seemingly ordinary <strong>steel delivery backpack</strong>!<br>With each stage cleared, expand your backpack, optimize deadly weapons and items, and create powerful synergies.<br>Build your ultimate <strong>weapon system</strong> to exploit enemy weaknesses!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Evolving Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The closer you get to your destination, the stronger and more unpredictable the space bugs become.<br>Adapt your combat style to counter their relentless mutations!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dodge... and Fire!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">May you survive and complete your delivery mission!</p>","developers":["KALA GAMES"],"dlc":[3576450],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569400